## الأعمال المضمَّنة · Third-party components

These carry their own licences, which survive this notice — the terms below
govern those components, not this work:

| Component | Where | Licence |
|---|---|---|
| **Cairo** (the Arabic typeface) | the website only, in `almuhallab/fonts/` — the desktop app bundles no font and uses the platform's own Arabic face | SIL Open Font License 1.1 — the full text sits beside the files in `almuhallab/fonts/LICENSE-Cairo.txt` and must stay with any copy of them |
| **Flutter** and the Dart SDK | the desktop app's toolchain | BSD 3-Clause, © Google LLC |
| **Inno Setup** | builds the Windows installer | Inno Setup License, © Jordan Russell |

The Cairo licence is not ours to waive: the OFL requires its text to travel
with the font files, and it does.

